  "message":
  "Try this:\n\n  [apply]     simp_all only [Nat.card_eq_fintype_card, map_one, MulEquiv.toMonoidHom_eq_coe]\n    obtain ⟨val, property⟩ := A\n    obtain ⟨w, h⟩ := property\n    obtain ⟨w_1, h⟩ := h\n    obtain ⟨left, right⟩ := h\n    obtain ⟨left_1, right⟩ := right\n    subst left_1\n    simp_all only [ne_eq]\n    rfl",
